\begin{remark}
\label{topping-ch8-no-collapsing-variant}
\dcref{8.3.2}
\group{perelman-w-entropy}
\source{topping:page-0096}
We could replace the $|R| \le r^{-2}$ hypothesis by $|R| \le C r^{-2}$,
although $\xi$ would then also depend on $C$.
\end{remark}

